          "settings": {
            "title": "Colección Tierra",
            "text": "<p>Red clay tableware: large and medium plates, soup and pasta bowls, and a cup. Shaped by hand without molds, and fired in the open air.</p><p>Prototypes are being made now.</p>",
            "kicker": "Red clay · San Marcos Tlapazola"
